ODW8502 `check_access_rights` is deprecated since Odoo 18.0. Use `check_access` instead, or `has_access` where a boolean is needed; an override belongs in `_check_access`, or `_access_domain` from 20.0.
  --> deprecated_odoo_method_call.py:8:14
   |
 7 |     def deprecated_in_18(self):
 8 |         self.check_access_rights("read")
   |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 9 |         self.check_access_rule("write")
10 |         self._filter_access_rules("read")
   |

ODW8502 [*] `check_access_rule` is deprecated since Odoo 18.0. Use `check_access` instead; an override belongs in `_check_access`, or `_access_domain` from 20.0.
  --> deprecated_odoo_method_call.py:9:14
   |
